From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.ui.xaml: Button, CommandBar, AppBarButton, AppBarSeparator, SymbolIcon

NanaZip's toolbar is a CommandBar of AppBarButtons; there were no buttons. ButtonBase (Click handlers kept, ClickMode, Command, CommandParameter), Button (Flyout), AppBarButton (Label, Icon -- "Add" in markup becomes a SymbolIcon -- or its content in the icon's place, labels hidden when the bar's DefaultLabelPosition is Collapsed), AppBarSeparator, AppBar (IsOpen, IsSticky), CommandBar (PrimaryCommands in a row, SecondaryCommands kept, DefaultLabelPosition), IconElement and SymbolIcon, RoutedEventArgs; AutomationProperties (Name, AutomationId, HelpText) and ToolTipService (ToolTip) attached properties kept. They look like the desktop's own -- its look's system colours, not Microsoft's templates; symbols come from the symbol font when it is installed, else as standard Unicode characters of the same meaning in a font that has them (symbols.txt: names and code points per windows-rs 0.30.0, the stand-ins ours); text set in that font is translated the same way. Stubs of properties not implemented yet: setters accept the value, getters give zero (C++/WinRT programs stop on E_NOTIMPL); FrameworkElement.ActualTheme and IsLoaded. Interface identity per windows-rs 0.30.0 (MIT OR Apache-2.0); the implementation is ours. Behind the XAML switch of 6131.
---
diff --git a/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/Makefile.in b/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/Makefile.in
index b371ca8..ddbcf2a 100644
--- a/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/Makefile.in
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@ IMPORTS = combase ole32 xmllite d2d1 dwrite user32 advapi32 uuid
 
 SOURCES = \
 	application.c \
+	buttons.c \
 	classes.idl \
 	control.c \
 	dependency.c \
diff --git a/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/application.c b/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/application.c
index 29c7117..948ec20 100644
--- a/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/application.c
+++ b/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/application.c
@@ -97,7 +97,7 @@ static const struct xclass app_class =
 };
 
 /* the theme the system asks for: AppsUseLightTheme, as Settings writes it */
-static INT32 system_app_theme(void)
+INT32 system_app_theme(void)
 {
     DWORD value = 1, size = sizeof(value);
 
diff --git a/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/buttons.c b/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/buttons.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..acbfbd6
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/windows.ui.xaml/buttons.c
@@ -0,0 +1,1216 @@
+/*
+ * Windows.UI.Xaml.Controls: ButtonBase, Button, AppBar, CommandBar, AppBarButton, AppBarSeparator,
+ * IconElement, SymbolIcon; Automation.AutomationProperties, ToolTipService; RoutedEventArgs
